values ('video-4079', 'https://play.niazitv.pk/drama/81/single-serie?watch=1&episode=4079', $src${"article_sections": [{"heading": "Watch Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles (Ishq Aur Takht) | NiaziPlay", "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 – Introduction", "paragraphs": ["A major new Turkish historical drama begins with Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles, also introduced to Urdu-speaking audiences as Ishq Aur Takht. The new Bozdağ Film production follows Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat’s extraordinary journey from years of imprisonment to the throne of the Anatolian Seljuk State.", "Premiering on ATV on September 9, 2026, Aşk ve Taht combines Seljuk history with love, betrayal, palace intrigue, dynastic rivalry, and the struggle for political power.", "At the center of Episode 1 are two interconnected dreams that keep Alaeddin alive during eight years of captivity: reclaiming the Seljuk throne inherited from his father and finding the mysterious green-eyed woman who once saved him.", "Urdu-speaking viewers can follow Aşk ve Taht Urdu Subtitles (Ishq Aur Takht) on NiaziPlay."]}, {"heading": "What Is Aşk ve Taht (Ishq Aur Takht)?", "paragraphs": ["Aşk ve Taht, literally associated with “Love and Throne,” is ATV's new historical period series produced by Bozdağ Film.", "The drama explores the story of Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat, one of the most prominent rulers of the Anatolian Seljuk State, while building its narrative around palace politics, warfare, family betrayals and Alaeddin's relationship with Princess Destina.", "The production stars Akın Akınözü as Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat, while Bosnian actress Merjem Šiljak plays Destina, the Princess of Kalonoros (Alanya). Simay Barlas portrays Melike Hüma, another crucial figure in Alaeddin's personal and dynastic struggle."]}, {"heading": "Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles – Full Story", "paragraphs": []}, {"heading": "Alaeddin Spends Eight Years in Prison", "paragraphs": ["Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 begins with Alaeddin carrying the scars of a devastating betrayal. His own mother and the atabey whom he once regarded as a father played roles in sending him into imprisonment. Alaeddin subsequently spends eight long years behind the walls of a dungeon. Those years transform him. Instead of destroying his ambitions, imprisonment strengthens his patience and determination. Two dreams prevent him from surrendering to despair. The first is the Seljuk throne that he believes is his rightful inheritance.", "The second is far more personal. It is the memory of a beautiful blonde-haired, green-eyed woman who extended her hand to him when he was close to death. Alaeddin has never forgotten her."]}, {"heading": "Alaeddin Keykubat Is Released from the Dungeon", "paragraphs": ["After eight years, the prison doors suddenly open. Waiting outside is Ayaba, one of the men connected to the darkest period of Alaeddin's life. Alaeddin initially believes that Ayaba has finally come to kill him. Instead, he receives news that completely changes his destiny. The Seljuk throne awaits him.", "The prisoner who spent years surrounded by darkness is suddenly preparing to become the ruler of one of the region's most powerful states. This transformation from dungeon to throne forms the foundation of Aşk ve Taht's story."]}, {"heading": "Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat Enters Konya", "paragraphs": ["News of Alaeddin Keykubat's rise quickly spreads throughout the region. Konya prepares for its new ruler, but his return also reopens old political wounds. Not everyone wants Alaeddin on the throne. His brother Melik Celaleddin has his own ambitions and considers the throne worth fighting for. Meanwhile, Alaeddin must eventually confront Ümmühan Hatun, his powerful mother whose decisions contributed to his years of imprisonment. Therefore, Alaeddin's greatest enemies may not be waiting outside the palace. Some are already inside it."]}, {"heading": "Who Is Princess Destina in Aşk ve Taht?", "paragraphs": ["While Konya prepares for Alaeddin, news of the new ruler also reaches Kalonoros, modern-day Alanya. For Princess Destina, the announcement carries a deeply personal meaning. Years earlier, she encountered a mysterious man whose life she touched without knowing his true identity. She has never completely forgotten him. Curious about the new Seljuk Sultan, Destina secretly travels to Konya in disguise. She has no idea that the journey will force her to confront her own past."]}, {"heading": "Destina Discovers Alaeddin's True Identity", "paragraphs": ["One of the defining moments of Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles comes when Sultan Alaeddin makes his grand entrance into Konya. Destina watches from among the crowd. Then she sees his face. The mysterious man she has remembered for years is none other than Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat. For Destina, the revelation is devastating.", "The man who once touched her heart now sits on the throne of a power she regards as an enemy. Alaeddin, meanwhile, still does not realize that Destina is the woman he has been searching for. Even during his years in prison, he remembered her green eyes. Now she is standing closer to him than he realizes."]}, {"heading": "Alaeddin and Destina's Love Story Begins", "paragraphs": ["The emotional foundation of Ishq Aur Takht Episode 1 is therefore built on a powerful contradiction. Alaeddin searches for Destina because she represents hope from the darkest period of his life. Destina discovers that the man she cannot forget is now her political enemy. Their relationship consequently begins between love and hostility, memory and reality, duty and desire. This conflict is expected to become one of the defining storylines of the series."]}, {"heading": "Melike Hüma and the Marriage Condition", "paragraphs": ["Alaeddin's return to the throne creates another major complication. Remaining Sultan may come with an unexpected political condition: marriage to his cousin Melike Hüma Hatun. Melike Hüma, played by Simay Barlas, belongs to the Seljuk dynasty and has strong feelings for Alaeddin. The proposed marriage transforms Alaeddin's personal struggle into a political one.", "He is searching for the mysterious woman who saved him, yet maintaining his throne may require him to marry someone else. This sets up a potential emotional and dynastic conflict between Alaeddin, Destina and Melike Hüma."]}, {"heading": "Betrayal and Palace Intrigue Begin in Episode 1", "paragraphs": ["Taking the throne does not guarantee Alaeddin's safety. In fact, it creates even more enemies. Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 establishes several competing forces inside and around the Seljuk palace. Old grievances return. Secret alliances begin forming. Members of the dynasty pursue their own interests, while the harem becomes another arena for political influence. Most dangerously, a conspiracy to eliminate the new Sultan is already developing in the shadows. Alaeddin may have escaped his dungeon, but the throne could prove even more dangerous."]}, {"heading": "Main Cast of Aşk ve Taht", "paragraphs": ["The series brings together a large cast for its Seljuk-era story."]}, {"heading": "Akın Akınözü as Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat", "paragraphs": ["Akın Akınözü leads the series as Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat. According to ATV, the actor underwent months of preparation for the role, including horse riding, archery, close-combat and physical training. His character is presented as intelligent, patient, artistic and formidable in battle—a prince hardened by eight years of imprisonment before ascending to the Seljuk throne."]}, {"heading": "Merjem Šiljak as Destina", "paragraphs": ["Bosnian actress Merjem Šiljak plays Princess Destina of Kalonoros. Destina is portrayed as both a warrior and diplomat. Her relationship with Alaeddin lies at the heart of the drama as hostility gradually collides with love. The series connects Destina's later journey with Hunad Hatun, making her development particularly important to the wider story."]}, {"heading": "Simay Barlas as Melike Hüma", "paragraphs": ["Simay Barlas portrays Melike Hüma, the daughter of Tuğrulşah and a woman of the Seljuk dynasty. Her feelings for Alaeddin and fear of losing him are expected to place her at the center of the palace's emotional and political struggles."]}, {"heading": "Other Important Cast Members", "paragraphs": ["The wider cast includes Ayça Bingöl as Ümmühan Hatun, Cem Bender as Ayaba, Halil İbrahim Ceyhan as Andreas, Ferit Kaya as Celaleddin, Ceren Benderlioğlu as Nurcihan, Emrah Altıntoprak as Kutluboğa, and Murat Serezli as Efendi Vard. Together, these characters establish the political world surrounding Alaeddin's new reign."]}, {"heading": "Who Produces Aşk ve Taht?", "paragraphs": ["Aşk ve Taht is produced by Bozdağ Film, with Mehmet Bozdağ behind the production and project design. The directing team includes Yağmur Taylan, Durul Taylan and Cem Toluay. The project has been designed as a large-scale historical production exploring the Anatolian Seljuk world through political rivalry, romance, war and palace intrigue."]}, {"heading": "When Was Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 Released?", "paragraphs": ["Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 premiered on Wednesday, September 9, 2026, at 8:00 PM on ATV in Türkiye. The first episode introduces Alaeddin's imprisonment, his unexpected path toward becoming Sultan, Destina's arrival in Konya and the political threats surrounding the new ruler."]}, {"heading": "Where to Watch Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles?", "paragraphs": ["International viewers looking for Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles can follow the series through NiaziPlay. NiaziPlay provides access for audiences interested in Turkish historical and Islamic series with Urdu and English subtitle options.", "Watch Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles on NiaziPlay. The series can also be searched under its Urdu-friendly title Ishq Aur Takht."]}, {"heading": "Why Aşk ve Taht Could Become a Major Historical Series", "paragraphs": ["Aşk ve Taht enters the 2026 television season with several elements that could attract viewers of Turkish historical dramas. It combines the rise of a powerful Seljuk ruler with a deeply personal love story. Instead of presenting Alaeddin's journey only through battles and conquests, the drama explores how imprisonment, betrayal, family conflict and love shape his path toward becoming Sultan.", "The series also has the production scale associated with Bozdağ Film, alongside a large ensemble cast and an important but comparatively less explored era of Anatolian Seljuk history. For audiences who enjoy palace intrigue, historical warfare and character-driven political dramas, Aşk ve Taht Urdu Subtitles has considerable potential."]}, {"heading": "What to Expect After Aşk ve Taht Episode 1", "paragraphs": ["The premiere establishes several major questions for upcoming episodes.", "Will Alaeddin finally recognize Destina as the mysterious woman who saved him?", "Can Destina reconcile her feelings for Alaeddin with her political loyalties?", "Will Alaeddin accept marriage to Melike Hüma to secure his throne?", "What will Melik Celaleddin do after Alaeddin's return?", "And most importantly, who will make the first serious attempt to remove the new Sultan?", "The answers will determine whether Alaeddin's greatest struggle was escaping the dungeon—or surviving the throne."]}, {"heading": "Final Thoughts", "paragraphs": ["Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles (Ishq Aur Takht) opens a new historical saga centered on Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat's remarkable journey from captivity to power.", "Eight years in prison have prepared Alaeddin for suffering, but they may not have prepared him for the betrayals waiting inside the Seljuk palace. At the same time, his unexpected reunion with Princess Destina introduces a love story complicated by politics, identity and old hostilities.", "With Alaeddin searching for the woman he remembers, Destina confronting the shocking identity of the man she once saved, and Melike Hüma emerging as a possible political bride, Episode 1 establishes love and the throne as two forces capable of defining—and threatening—the new Sultan's reign.", "Follow Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles and upcoming Ishq Aur Takht Urdu Subtitles episodes on NiaziPlay."]}, {"heading": "References", "paragraphs": ["ATV – Aşk ve Taht Official Series Page", "ATV – Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 Preview and Synopsis", "NiaziPlay - Ishq Aur Takht Urdu Subtitles"]}], "article_text": "Watch Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles (Ishq Aur Takht) | NiaziPlay Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 – Introduction A major new Turkish historical drama begins with Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles, also introduced to Urdu-speaking audiences as Ishq Aur Takht. The new Bozdağ Film production follows Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat’s extraordinary journey from years of imprisonment to the throne of the Anatolian Seljuk State. Premiering on ATV on September 9, 2026, Aşk ve Taht combines Seljuk history with love, betrayal, palace intrigue, dynastic rivalry, and the struggle for political power. At the center of Episode 1 are two interconnected dreams that keep Alaeddin alive during eight years of captivity: reclaiming the Seljuk throne inherited from his father and finding the mysterious green-eyed woman who once saved him. Urdu-speaking viewers can follow Aşk ve Taht Urdu Subtitles (Ishq Aur Takht) on NiaziPlay. What Is Aşk ve Taht (Ishq Aur Takht)? Aşk ve Taht, literally associated with “Love and Throne,” is ATV's new historical period series produced by Bozdağ Film. The drama explores the story of Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat, one of the most prominent rulers of the Anatolian Seljuk State, while building its narrative around palace politics, warfare, family betrayals and Alaeddin's relationship with Princess Destina. The production stars Akın Akınözü as Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat, while Bosnian actress Merjem Šiljak plays Destina, the Princess of Kalonoros (Alanya). Simay Barlas portrays Melike Hüma, another crucial figure in Alaeddin's personal and dynastic struggle. Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles – Full Story Alaeddin Spends Eight Years in Prison Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 begins with Alaeddin carrying the scars of a devastating betrayal. His own mother and the atabey whom he once regarded as a father played roles in sending him into imprisonment. Alaeddin subsequently spends eight long years behind the walls of a dungeon. Those years transform him. Instead of destroying his ambitions, imprisonment strengthens his patience and determination. Two dreams prevent him from surrendering to despair. The first is the Seljuk throne that he believes is his rightful inheritance. The second is far more personal. It is the memory of a beautiful blonde-haired, green-eyed woman who extended her hand to him when he was close to death. Alaeddin has never forgotten her. Alaeddin Keykubat Is Released from the Dungeon After eight years, the prison doors suddenly open. Waiting outside is Ayaba, one of the men connected to the darkest period of Alaeddin's life. Alaeddin initially believes that Ayaba has finally come to kill him. Instead, he receives news that completely changes his destiny. The Seljuk throne awaits him. The prisoner who spent years surrounded by darkness is suddenly preparing to become the ruler of one of the region's most powerful states. This transformation from dungeon to throne forms the foundation of Aşk ve Taht's story. Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat Enters Konya News of Alaeddin Keykubat's rise quickly spreads throughout the region. Konya prepares for its new ruler, but his return also reopens old political wounds. Not everyone wants Alaeddin on the throne. His brother Melik Celaleddin has his own ambitions and considers the throne worth fighting for. Meanwhile, Alaeddin must eventually confront Ümmühan Hatun, his powerful mother whose decisions contributed to his years of imprisonment. Therefore, Alaeddin's greatest enemies may not be waiting outside the palace. Some are already inside it. Who Is Princess Destina in Aşk ve Taht? While Konya prepares for Alaeddin, news of the new ruler also reaches Kalonoros, modern-day Alanya. For Princess Destina, the announcement carries a deeply personal meaning. Years earlier, she encountered a mysterious man whose life she touched without knowing his true identity. She has never completely forgotten him. Curious about the new Seljuk Sultan, Destina secretly travels to Konya in disguise. She has no idea that the journey will force her to confront her own past. Destina Discovers Alaeddin's True Identity One of the defining moments of Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles comes when Sultan Alaeddin makes his grand entrance into Konya. Destina watches from among the crowd. Then she sees his face. The mysterious man she has remembered for years is none other than Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat. For Destina, the revelation is devastating. The man who once touched her heart now sits on the throne of a power she regards as an enemy. Alaeddin, meanwhile, still does not realize that Destina is the woman he has been searching for. Even during his years in prison, he remembered her green eyes. Now she is standing closer to him than he realizes. Alaeddin and Destina's Love Story Begins The emotional foundation of Ishq Aur Takht Episode 1 is therefore built on a powerful contradiction. Alaeddin searches for Destina because she represents hope from the darkest period of his life. Destina discovers that the man she cannot forget is now her political enemy. Their relationship consequently begins between love and hostility, memory and reality, duty and desire. This conflict is expected to become one of the defining storylines of the series. Melike Hüma and the Marriage Condition Alaeddin's return to the throne creates another major complication. Remaining Sultan may come with an unexpected political condition: marriage to his cousin Melike Hüma Hatun. Melike Hüma, played by Simay Barlas, belongs to the Seljuk dynasty and has strong feelings for Alaeddin. The proposed marriage transforms Alaeddin's personal struggle into a political one. He is searching for the mysterious woman who saved him, yet maintaining his throne may require him to marry someone else. This sets up a potential emotional and dynastic conflict between Alaeddin, Destina and Melike Hüma. Betrayal and Palace Intrigue Begin in Episode 1 Taking the throne does not guarantee Alaeddin's safety. In fact, it creates even more enemies. Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 establishes several competing forces inside and around the Seljuk palace. Old grievances return. Secret alliances begin forming. Members of the dynasty pursue their own interests, while the harem becomes another arena for political influence. Most dangerously, a conspiracy to eliminate the new Sultan is already developing in the shadows. Alaeddin may have escaped his dungeon, but the throne could prove even more dangerous. Main Cast of Aşk ve Taht The series brings together a large cast for its Seljuk-era story. Akın Akınözü as Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat Akın Akınözü leads the series as Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat. According to ATV, the actor underwent months of preparation for the role, including horse riding, archery, close-combat and physical training. His character is presented as intelligent, patient, artistic and formidable in battle—a prince hardened by eight years of imprisonment before ascending to the Seljuk throne. Merjem Šiljak as Destina Bosnian actress Merjem Šiljak plays Princess Destina of Kalonoros. Destina is portrayed as both a warrior and diplomat. Her relationship with Alaeddin lies at the heart of the drama as hostility gradually collides with love. The series connects Destina's later journey with Hunad Hatun, making her development particularly important to the wider story. Simay Barlas as Melike Hüma Simay Barlas portrays Melike Hüma, the daughter of Tuğrulşah and a woman of the Seljuk dynasty. Her feelings for Alaeddin and fear of losing him are expected to place her at the center of the palace's emotional and political struggles. Other Important Cast Members The wider cast includes Ayça Bingöl as Ümmühan Hatun, Cem Bender as Ayaba, Halil İbrahim Ceyhan as Andreas, Ferit Kaya as Celaleddin, Ceren Benderlioğlu as Nurcihan, Emrah Altıntoprak as Kutluboğa, and Murat Serezli as Efendi Vard. Together, these characters establish the political world surrounding Alaeddin's new reign. Who Produces Aşk ve Taht? Aşk ve Taht is produced by Bozdağ Film, with Mehmet Bozdağ behind the production and project design. The directing team includes Yağmur Taylan, Durul Taylan and Cem Toluay. The project has been designed as a large-scale historical production exploring the Anatolian Seljuk world through political rivalry, romance, war and palace intrigue. When Was Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 Released? Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 premiered on Wednesday, September 9, 2026, at 8:00 PM on ATV in Türkiye. The first episode introduces Alaeddin's imprisonment, his unexpected path toward becoming Sultan, Destina's arrival in Konya and the political threats surrounding the new ruler. Where to Watch Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles? International viewers looking for Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles can follow the series through NiaziPlay. NiaziPlay provides access for audiences interested in Turkish historical and Islamic series with Urdu and English subtitle options. Watch Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles on NiaziPlay. The series can also be searched under its Urdu-friendly title Ishq Aur Takht. Why Aşk ve Taht Could Become a Major Historical Series Aşk ve Taht enters the 2026 television season with several elements that could attract viewers of Turkish historical dramas. It combines the rise of a powerful Seljuk ruler with a deeply personal love story. Instead of presenting Alaeddin's journey only through battles and conquests, the drama explores how imprisonment, betrayal, family conflict and love shape his path toward becoming Sultan. The series also has the production scale associated with Bozdağ Film, alongside a large ensemble cast and an important but comparatively less explored era of Anatolian Seljuk history. For audiences who enjoy palace intrigue, historical warfare and character-driven political dramas, Aşk ve Taht Urdu Subtitles has considerable potential. What to Expect After Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 The premiere establishes several major questions for upcoming episodes. Will Alaeddin finally recognize Destina as the mysterious woman who saved him? Can Destina reconcile her feelings for Alaeddin with her political loyalties? Will Alaeddin accept marriage to Melike Hüma to secure his throne? What will Melik Celaleddin do after Alaeddin's return? And most importantly, who will make the first serious attempt to remove the new Sultan? The answers will determine whether Alaeddin's greatest struggle was escaping the dungeon—or surviving the throne. Final Thoughts Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles (Ishq Aur Takht) opens a new historical saga centered on Sultan Alaeddin Keykubat's remarkable journey from captivity to power. Eight years in prison have prepared Alaeddin for suffering, but they may not have prepared him for the betrayals waiting inside the Seljuk palace. At the same time, his unexpected reunion with Princess Destina introduces a love story complicated by politics, identity and old hostilities. With Alaeddin searching for the woman he remembers, Destina confronting the shocking identity of the man she once saved, and Melike Hüma emerging as a possible political bride, Episode 1 establishes love and the throne as two forces capable of defining—and threatening—the new Sultan's reign. Follow Aşk ve Taht Episode 1 with Urdu Subtitles and upcoming Ishq Aur Takht Urdu Subtitles episodes on NiaziPlay. References ATV – Aşk ve Taht Official Series Page ATV – Aşk ve Taht Episode 