ifficult with every new development. Destina makes a bold move by presenting Melike as a traitor before Alaeddin. Her accusation completely changes the relationship between the two women and turns their hidden rivalry into an open conflict. At the same time, Celaleddin becomes involved in the mystery surrounding the secret passage. His imprisonment creates new problems inside the palace and increases the risk that secrets connected to Destina could be revealed. Destina Accuses Melike of Being a Traitor One of the biggest developments in Ishq Aur Takht Episode 4 English Subtitles begins when Destina presents Melike as a traitor before Sultan Alaeddin. The unexpected accusation deeply affects Melike and increases her anger towards Destina. Their struggle is no longer hidden behind palace manners. The conflict between them begins to unfold openly. For Destina, however, this is more than a personal fight with Melike. She is trying to protect herself while Alaeddin continues searching for answers about the secrets around him. The more Destina tries to control the situation, the more attention she attracts. Why Does Destina Name Celaleddin? Alaeddin wants to know how Destina learned that Melike was inside the secret passage. When he questions her, Destina gives Celaleddin name. This answer has serious consequences. Celaleddin is imprisoned, which pleases Ummuhan. However, his imprisonment also pushes Nurcihan and Ayaba into action. The palace becomes increasingly tense as different characters react to Celaleddin arrest and begin making their own moves. Celaleddin Imprisonment Creates a New Danger Celaleddin imprisonment is particularly dangerous for Destina because it increases the possibility that hidden information may come to light. Destina realizes that waiting could leave her exposed. She therefore decides to make a dangerous move to protect herself before the truth can reach Alaeddin. Her plan, however, does not go smoothly. While Destina is carrying out her next move, someone discovers her secret meeting. The discovery creates another major mystery in Ask ve Taht Bolum 4: who has caught Destina, and how much does that person now know? Who Discovers Destina Secret Meeting? The official Episode 4 story leaves the identity of the person who discovers Destina meeting unanswered. This makes the situation even more dangerous for her. Destina does not know exactly how much of her plan has been seen or heard. Until this point, she has survived by thinking quickly and keeping important parts of her identity hidden. But several problems are now closing in around her at the same time. Melike openly sees her as an enemy, Celaleddin is in prison, her secret meeting has been discovered, and Alaeddin is getting closer to the truth. Alaeddin Gets Closer to Destina True Identity Sultan Alaeddin has become increasingly suspicious of Destina. In Ask ve Taht Season 1 Episode 4, he decides that simple questions are no longer enough. Alaeddin wants to learn whether Destina is actually a princess. To find the answer, he sets out on a journey that could finally uncover the truth about her identity. This is an important turning point because Alaeddin is now actively looking for proof rather than relying only on what Destina tells him. Alaeddin Journey Could Decide Destina Fate Alaeddin journey becomes one of the most important parts of Episode 4. He expects it to help him uncover the secrets surrounding Destina, but unexpected events along the way could change everything. The question is no longer simply whether Alaeddin suspects Destina. The real question is what he will discover and what he will bring back with him. If he finds proof that Destina is a princess, her position inside the palace could change immediately. The revelation would also affect their personal relationship, because Destina identity is closely connected to the conflicts Alaeddin has been trying to understand. Will Destina Secret Finally Be Revealed? The biggest question surrounding Ask ve Taht Episode 4 English Subtitles is whether Destina can keep her identity hidden for much longer. Several threats are now moving towards the same secret. Her conflict with Melike has become open. Celaleddin imprisonment could lead to hidden information being revealed. Someone has discovered her secret meeting, and Alaeddin himself has started investigating whether she is really a princess. Destina has managed to protect herself until now, but Bolum 4 makes it clear that her options are becoming limited. How Alaeddin returns from his journey could decide what happens to Destina next. What Happened Before Episode 4? In Episode 3, Alaeddin prepared for conflict with Kalonoros while Destina found herself caught between her family and the Sultan. Her brother Arakel was brought to the infirmary wounded, while Celaleddin and Andreas were also searching for him. At the same time, Alaeddin moved closer to uncovering both the betrayal connected to Kalonoros and Destina real identity. Destina was also given an opportunity to escape, leaving her with a difficult choice between protecting her secret and trying to prevent the coming conflict. Those events lead directly into Episode 4, where the consequences of Destina choices begin to appear inside the palace. Watch Ask ve Taht Episode 4 English Subtitles on NiaziPlay Viewers looking for Ask ve Taht Episode 4 English Subtitles or Ishq Aur Takht Episode 4 English Subtitles can follow the latest episode on NiaziPlay. Bolum 4 continues Sultan Alaeddin and Destina story as palace secrets become increasingly difficult to hide. With Melike turning openly against Destina, Celaleddin behind bars and Alaeddin personally searching for answers, the mystery surrounding Destina is moving closer to a major revelation. You can also watch the previous English Subtitle episodes below to follow the complete story from the beginning. Watch Previous Episodes of Ask ve Taht English Subtitles Catch up before watching Episode 4: Episode 1 English Subtitles - Alaeddin Journey Begins Episode 2 English Subtitles - Destina Enters Alaeddin Palace Episode 3 English Subtitles - Alaeddin Moves Towards Kalonoros View All Ishq Aur Takht Season 1 Episodes Final Thoughts Ask ve Taht Episode 4 English Subtitles brings the mystery surrounding Destina closer to a major turning point. Her accusation against Melike changes the atmosphere inside the palace, while Celaleddin imprisonment creates the possibility that more secrets could come to light. Destina attempts another dangerous move to protect herself, but her secret meeting is discovered. At the same time, Alaeddin begins a journey to learn whether she is really a princess. With Alaeddin getting closer to the truth from one side and Destina secrets becoming harder to protect from the other, Ishq Aur Takht Episode 4 leaves her future uncertain. Watch Ask ve Taht Episode 4 with English Subtitles on NiaziPlay and follow the next chapter of Sultan Alaeddin and Destina story. References ATV - Ask ve Taht Episode 4 Official Photo Gallery ATV - Ask ve Taht Official Series Page NiaziPlay - Ishq Aur Takht Season 1 Urdu and English Subtitles", "bolum": null, "canonical_drama": "Aşk ve Taht", "catalog_heading": "Ishq Aur Takht | Aşk ve Taht - Urdu & English Subtitles", "catalog_id": "81", "catalog_issues": [], "catalog_season_source": "default_single_season", "catalog_seasons": [1], "collected_at": "2026-10-01T12:38:35.217911+00:00", "collection_id": "collection-81", "content_type": "episode", "description": "Ask ve Taht Episode 4 with English Subtitles puts Destina in one of her most dangerous situations yet. Her attempt to protect herself changes the balance inside the palace, while Sultan Alaeddin becomes increasingly determined to discover who she really is.", "description_status": "extracted", "direct_playback_status": "not_tested", "display_label": "Episode 4", "drama": "Aşk ve Taht", "drama_id": "ask-ve-taht", "duration": "PT0H0M0S", "episode": 4, "episode_group_id": 